==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|gebūwede}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|gibūidi}}. Literally meaning ''das Gebaute'' "that has been built".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɡəˈbɔʏ̯də]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Gebäude.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
